    "title": "Live Football Tv : Live Score",
    "description": "This app provides  all football live updates score without any disturbance. Who do not love football around the world. Its bring a great facility to get recent football score updates here. So you can enjoy all latest score updates in this app. \r\n\r\nThere are few tabs. Those are:\r\n\uf0d8\tLive\r\n\uf0d8\tMatches\r\n\uf0d8\tLeagues\r\n\r\nUsers can find live score in score tabs. It covers all national, international and club football score live. It has match info, line up, match events etc.\r\n\r\nIn video section users may get football highlights of those videos which are copyright free . But we do not allow to upload copyrighted content or video highlights. So do not hope we upload all football highlights in our app. It may take time to upload video highlights after finished the match. \r\n\r\nIn all section you can see all country bilateral, club football here. It is separated by country so you can easily find  your favourite team here.\r\n\r\nWe tried to cover probably all up to date football related news here. If you want to know what is happening about football around the world users can choose this app to see football related updates here",
    "descriptionHTML": "This app provides  all football live updates score without any disturbance. Who do not love football around the world. Its bring a great facility to get recent football score updates here. So you can enjoy all latest score updates in this app. <br><br>There are few tabs. Those are:<br>\uf0d8\tLive<br>\uf0d8\tMatches<br>\uf0d8\tLeagues<br><br>Users can find live score in score tabs. It covers all national, international and club football score live. It has match info, line up, match events etc.<br><br>In video section users may get football highlights of those videos which are copyright free . But we do not allow to upload copyrighted content or video highlights. So do not hope we upload all football highlights in our app. It may take time to upload video highlights after finished the match. <br><br>In all section you can see all country bilateral, club football here. It is separated by country so you can easily find  your favourite team here.<br><br>We tried to cover probably all up to date football related news here. If you want to know what is happening about football around the world users can choose this app to see football related updates here",
